  "extraction_notes": "Generic header substrate 1 and amino ester 4 contain unspecified side chains/ester group, captured with wildcards. Catalyst D structure is not drawn in this panel, so reagent SMILES left empty. Product 5ma appears to be an N-trityl histidine derivative; exact trityl-substituted imidazole connectivity is difficult to read at this resolution, and the validated SMILES records the imidazole side chain with a benzyl substituent as a low-confidence approximation rather than the full trityl group. In entries 5ka and 5la, side-chain protecting groups were interpreted as OBn and NHBoc, respectively."
